rs, einer Rüge nicht abhelfen zu wollen, bei der Vergabekammer einzureichen."},{"code":"4","field_id":"TED-RP_REGULATION","list":null,"ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"field_id":"TED-SHORT_DESCR","lang":"DE","ordinal":0,"type":"text","value":"Lieferung, Installation und Inbetriebnahme einer digitalen Röntgenanlage als Röntgenkabine inkl. Bedienelemente und Kühlung zur Überprüfung von Schweißnähten."},{"field_id":"TED-SHORT_DESCR","lang":"DE","ordinal":1,"type":"text","value":"Die Röntgenanlage muss in der Lage sein, Durchstrahlungsbilder der Schweißverbindungen herzustellen, welche mindestens den Anforderungen der DIN EN ISO 17636-2: 2013-05 Prüfklasse B, entsprechen."},{"field_id":"TED-SUITABILITY","lang":"DE","ordinal":0,"type":"text","value":"Bitte entnehmen Sie die Bedingungen den Auftragsunterlagen"},{"code":"3","field_id":"TED-TD_DOCUMENT_TYPE","list":null,"ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"field_id":"TED-TECHNICAL_CRITERIA_DOC","ordinal":0,"type":"integer","value":1},{"field_id":"TED-TITLE","lang":"DE","ordinal":0,"type":"text","value":"Lieferung, Installation und Inbetriebnahme einer digitalen Röntgenanlage"},{"field_id":"TED-TI_CY","lang":"BG","ordinal":0,"type":"text","value":"Гepмaния"},{"field_id":"TED-TI_CY","lang":"CS","ordinal":1,"type":"text","value":"Německo"},{"field_id":"TED-TI_CY","lang":"DA","ordinal":2,"type":"text","value":"Tyskland"},{"field_id":"TED-TI_CY","lang":"DE","ordinal":3,"type":"text","value":"Deutschland"},{"field_id":"TED-TI_CY","lang":"EL","ordinal":4,"type":"text","value":"Γερμανία"},{"field_id":"TED-TI_CY","lang":"EN","ordinal":5,"type":"text","value":"Germany"},{"field_id":"TED-TI_CY","lang":"ES","ordinal":6,"type":"text","value":"Alemania"},{"field_id":"TED-TI_CY","lang":"ET","ordinal":7,"type":"text","value":"Saksamaa"},{"field_id":"TED-TI_CY","lang":"FI","ordinal":8,"type":"text","value":"Saksa"},{"field_id":"TED-TI_CY","lang":"FR","ordinal":9,"type":"text","value":"Allemagne"},{"field_id":"TED-TI_CY","lang":"GA","ordinal":10,"type":"